.TH SSGRID 1 2000-1月 "perturb_export" "perturb_export"
.SH NAME
perturb_export \- save the virtual perturbation screening result as csv files
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIperturb_export(\fBscreening\fR as <generic> ScreeningResult, 
\fBdir\fR as string);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
save the virtual perturbation screening result as csv files
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBscreening\fB \fR\- the output of the \fBperturb\fR api.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBdir\fB \fR\- the output directory.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
the number of the files that has been written.
.PP
.SH DETAILS
.PP
this function writes the \fBcontrol.csv\fR and the \fBperturb_records.csv\fR; 
 the trajectory of each perturbation design is not kept in the screening 
 result object, so please use the \fBexport\fR parameter of the \fBperturb\fR 
 api if the trajectory files are required.
.PP
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
perturb_export(resp, "/tmp/ko");
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
ssGrid
.SH FILES
.PP
biosystem.dll
.PP
